flowchart TB
  Repo["E17 Supplied repo bindings<br/>distinct worktrees and allowed paths"] -->|"each has 1 declared scope"| Changes["E18 Change selection<br/>resolved commits or approximate dirty recency"]
  Repo -->|"1..n captures in E11"| Snap["E11 Frozen source snapshot<br/>repo and revision attribution"]
  Changes -->|"0..n changed before/after units"| Unit["E19 Source unit<br/>source side, kind and byte range"]
  Snap -->|"units refer to captured bytes"| Unit
  Unit -->|"0..n attributed links within supplied roots"| Rel["E20 Relationship candidate<br/>candidate, contradicted or unresolved"]
  Unit -->|"1..n related excerpts"| Chunk["E21 Semantic chunk<br/>required context and explicit optional omissions"]
  Rel -->|"relationships preserved"| Chunk
  Chunk -->|"part of 1 proposed request"| Budget["E22 Context budget<br/>exact, estimated or unavailable accounting"]
  Budget -->|"within configured budget and ready evidence"| Judge["E4 Request / E5 Judgment<br/>validated E6 answer or execution failure"]
  Budget -->|"required overflow or unverifiable"| Failure["E14 Diagnostic<br/>no inference and no pass"]
